            "id": 10,
            "options": {
                "code": {
                    "language": "plaintext",
                    "showLineNumbers": false,
                    "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "## Investigating Pipeline Errors\n\n### Step 1: Get the Correlation ID\nWhen a pipeline fails, the user receives a **correlationId** (e.g., `47872a4f-2e22-4055-959d-ef5eec2aa518`).\n\n### Step 2: Search in Jaeger\n1. Enter the correlationId in the **Search Traces by Correlation ID** panel above.\n2. Alternatively, open [Jaeger UI](http://localhost:16686/search) directly and search for:\n   - **Service**: `PTFD`\n   - **Tags**: `messaging.conversation_id=YOUR_CORRELATION_ID`\n\n### Step 3: Analyze the Trace\n- Look for spans with **error=true** status.\n- Check the **error.type** and **error.message** tags to understand the failure.\n- Review the trace timeline to see which step failed.\n\n### Metric Labels for Filtering\n- **Job Errors**: `job_type`, `job_processortype`\n- **Processor Errors**: `processor_type`, `processor_action`\n- **Artifact Errors**: `artifact_type`, `artifact_action`",
                "mode": "markdown"
            },
            "pluginVersion": "10.1.2",
            "title": "Investigation Guide",
            "type": "text"
        }
